			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1770306511014,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "STATEFUL\n\nStateful services keep user info\n(state) between requests. So requests\nmust go to the same server that has\nthe user’s data, which makes scaling\nharder.",
			"rawText": "STATEFUL\n\nStateful services keep user info (state) between requests. So requests must go to the same server that has the user’s data, which makes scaling harder.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "JGMB6JJu",
			"originalText": "STATEFUL\n\nStateful services keep user info (state) between requests. So requests must go to the same server that has the user’s data, which makes scaling harder.",
